      <div class="faq-item open"><button class="faq-q" onclick="this.closest('.faq-item').classList.toggle('open')">What if I'm worried about the cost of treatment?<svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg></button><div class="faq-a">Call us. We accept private pay and are actively building our insurance network — and we believe cost should never be the reason someone doesn't get help. When you call, we'll have an honest conversation about what options are available to you. We will do everything we can to make treatment accessible.</div></div>
