      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" onclick="this.closest('.faq-item').classList.toggle('open')">Is Sunbright a Christian rehab?<svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg></button><div class="faq-a">Sunbright is faith-integrated, not faith-required. Spiritual support is available for those who want it — but recovery here does not require any particular religious belief. Everyone is welcome.</div></div>
